        {
          "id": "s002",
          "text": "În viață, vei învăța cele mai multe lucruri printr-un proces dezordonat și ineficient de încercări și greșeli.",
          "kind": "attributed",
          "display_role": "quote card",
          "fit": "not_checked",
          "source": {
            "id": "B508A471-CA49-496B-BC71-AC09046FBF59",
            "category": "influential_people",
            "text": "You're going to learn most of the things that you learn in life through messy, inefficient trial and error",
            "attribution": {
              "name": "Angela Duckworth",
              "personId": "angela-duckworth",
              "country": "US",
              "fields": [
                "Philosophers, psychologists and public intellectuals"
              ]
            },
            "language": "en",
            "context": "Duckworth's Learning Day session at Wharton",
            "source": {
              "url": "https://globalyouth.wharton.upenn.edu/articles/business/whartons-grit-expert-discusses-making-decisions-and-embracing-exploration/",
              "publisher": "Wharton Global Youth Program (University of Pennsylvania)",
              "title": "Wharton's Grit Expert Discusses Making Decisions and Embracing Exploration",
              "published": null,
              "retrieved": "2026-08-18",
              "tier": "primary",
              "verifiedBy": "refetch"
            },
            "verification": "sourced"
          },
          "candidate_hash": "7bd7b5feed65020b9752cb17dcdf64cdd024b82fa499812562efbfbb9dcf1eee",
          "canonical": null
        },
        {
          "id": "s003",
          "text": "Ține minte că eșecul nu este un rău necesar — de fapt, nu este deloc un rău. Este o consecință inevitabilă a faptului că faci ceva nou.",
          "kind": "attributed",
          "display_role": "quote card",
          "fit": "not_checked",
          "source": {
            "id": "BFCC82A8-701D-4F90-95F9-A31FBB8857B2",
            "category": "influential_people",
            "text": "Remember that failure isn't a necessary evil – in fact, it isn't evil at all. It is a necessary consequence of doing something new.",
            "attribution": {
              "name": "Ed Catmull",
              "personId": "ed-catmull",
              "country": "US",
              "fields": [
                "Animators and animation studio founders"
